        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T15:32:04"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 515,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 554,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70610,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 162,
        "headingId": 554,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> an invasive serous tumour.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> positive immunoreactivity for PAX8 and negativity for calretinin.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T15:32:04"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 513,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 552,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70611,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 162,
        "headingId": 552,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>There is no American Joint Committee on Cancer (AJCC) staging system for these tumours.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T15:32:04"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 514,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 553,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70612,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 162,
        "headingId": 553,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The majority of reported serous cystadenocarcinomas are low-grade {25491441}; however, these tumours can metastasize. The prognosis of patients with metastatic disease is unfavourable {7503358; 28764180}. There have been no studies such as those for the ovarian counterpart that could link a more aggressive clinical course with morphological and genetic findings {25491441}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T15:32:04"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]